[
  {
    "filename": "docstructbench_dianzishu_zhongwenzaixian-o.O-63686436.pdf_57.pdf",
    "page_index": 57,
    "core_content": {
      "parsing_res_list": [
        {
          "block_label": "header",
          "block_content": "习茶课",
          "block_bbox": [
            268,
            112,
            477,
            168
          ],
          "block_id": 0,
          "block_order": null
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "武夷岩茶有“茶中之王”的美誉，为中国大名茶之一，其中大红袍是武夷岩茶中的极品，享誉全球。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            675,
            337,
            1826,
            435
          ],
          "block_id": 1,
          "block_order": 1
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "大红袍",
          "block_bbox": [
            247,
            338,
            498,
            422
          ],
          "block_id": 2,
          "block_order": 2
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "历史传说",
          "block_bbox": [
            193,
            2207,
            379,
            2253
          ],
          "block_id": 3,
          "block_order": 3
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "武夷岩茶历史悠久，而大红袍乃是武夷岩茶中的佼佼者。大红袍之所以特别引人关注，首先在于它的稀贵。历史上的大红袍，本来就少，而如今公认的大红袍茶树，仅是九龙窠岩壁上的那几棵。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            168,
            2301,
            963,
            2571
          ],
          "block_id": 4,
          "block_order": 4
        },
        {
          "block_label": "image",
          "block_content": "外形茶汤叶底\n紧结壮实，稍扭曲，色泽汤色深橙黄，香气浓长，软亮匀齐\n油润滋味醇厚，岩韵明显\n\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            174,
            531,
            1830,
            1435
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": null
        },
        {
          "block_label": "vision_footnote",
          "block_content": "产区福建武夷山。",
          "block_bbox": [
            189,
            1505,
            510,
            1548
          ],
          "block_id": 6,
          "block_order": null
        },
        {
          "block_label": "image",
          "block_content": "",
          "block_bbox": [
            365,
            1648,
            747,
            2139
          ],
          "block_id": 7,
          "block_order": null
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "保健功效",
          "block_bbox": [
            1060,
            1504,
            1250,
            1549
          ],
          "block_id": 8,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "强心解挛：大红袍中的咖啡碱具有强心、解痉、松弛平滑肌的功效，能解除支气管痉挛，促进血液循环。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            1040,
            1599,
            1827,
            1754
          ],
          "block_id": 9,
          "block_order": 6
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "抗菌抑菌：大红袍中的茶多酚和酸作用于细菌，能凝固细菌的蛋白质，将细菌杀死。",
          "block_bbox": [
            1040,
            1797,
            1827,
            1895
          ],
          "block_id": 10,
          "block_order": 7
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "最佳品饮时节春夏时节。",
          "block_bbox": [
            1059,
            1962,
            1531,
            2006
          ],
          "block_id": 11,
          "block_order": 8
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "储藏方法",
          "block_bbox": [
            1059,
            2085,
            1251,
            2131
          ],
          "block_id": 12,
          "block_order": 9
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "大红袍保存时最好不要使用玻璃罐、瓷罐、木盒或药罐，因为这些器具具有透光、不防潮、易碎的缺点。最好先用小罐子分装少量茶叶，以便随时取用，其余的茶叶则用大罐子密封起来储存在冰箱里保存。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            1038,
            2166,
            1829,
            2439
          ],
          "block_id": 13,
          "block_order": 10
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "适合人群",
          "block_bbox": [
            1058,
            2521,
            1251,
            2567
          ],
          "block_id": 14,
          "block_order": 11
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "一般人群皆可饮用，儿童、孕妇不适宜饮用。",
          "block_bbox": [
            1041,
            2604,
            1776,
            2642
          ],
          "block_id": 15,
          "block_order": 12
        },
        {
          "block_label": "number",
          "block_content": "50",
          "block_bbox": [
            174,
            2702,
            217,
            2732
          ],
          "block_id": 16,
          "block_order": null
        }
      ],
